Route14_Text_WorkerF::
	.string "That is the PILLAR OF WISHES.\p"
	.string "They say a certain POKéMON came from\n"
	.string "the stars and made that pillar.\p"
	.string "Now people come to make their\n"
	.string "wishes at the pillar.\p"
	.string "I wonder if we’ll ever see that\n"
	.string "POKéMON again?$"

Route14_Text_BirdKeeperRoyIntro::
	.string "My dream is to fly with my beloved\n"
	.string "bird POKéMON.$"

Route14_Text_BirdKeeperRoyDefeat::
	.string "I can dream, but I can’t ever fly...$"

Route14_Text_BirdKeeperRoy::
	.string "You have POKéMON that know the HM\n"
	.string "move FLY, don’t you?\l"
	.string "I envy you.$"

Route14_Text_PokefanCarterIntro::
	.string "Let me tell you, I had a hard time\n"
	.string "catching my prized POKéMON.$"

Route14_Text_PokefanCarterDefeat::
	.string "Awaaah!$"

Route14_Text_PokefanCarter::
	.string "SQUIRTLE, CHARMANDER and\n"
	.string "BULBASAUR...\p"
	.string "I think that’s a well-balanced mix.$"

Route14_Text_PokefanTrevorIntro::
	.string "Did you battle all the GYM trainers?$"

Route14_Text_PokefanTrevorDefeat::
	.string "Oh, wow!\n"
	.string "Too strong for me!$"

Route14_Text_PokefanTrevor::
	.string "If you have KANTO BADGES, they’ll\n"
	.string "help you in linked battles.$"

Route14_Text_Sign1_1::
	.string "{PLAYER} makes a wish...$"

Route14_Text_Sign1_2::
	.string "Huh? {PLAYER} finds a POKéMON EGG?$"

Route14_Text_Sign1_3::
	.string "{PLAYER} received EGG.$"
